const props={"page": {"url": "/supporters/", "title": "Featured sponsors", "description": "Meet 11 marine sponsors through practical diesel-yacht ownership, engine-space planning, onboard storage and life at anchor. Explore each dedicated feature.", "schema": ["WebPage"], "pageType": "utility", "status": "ready", "indexable": true, "blockers": [], "headings": [], "faqs": [], "parent": "/supporters/", "parentTitle": "Featured sponsors"}};
const content="<section class=\"sn-page\"><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Our network sponsors</p><h1>Featured sponsors</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Explore our sponsors through life aboard an engine-maintained yacht. Each company has its own feature written for Marine Diesel Engine.</p><div class=\"sn-grid\"><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/boateye360/logo.webp\" alt=\"BoatEye360 logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">BoatEye360</a></h2><p>Engine work can be a convenient time to document nearby equipment, but a camera installation needs its own assessment.</p><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/captain-matt/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"Captain Matt logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Captain Matt</a></h2><p>Owners often need help translating an engine concern into an organised work plan.</p><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/easy-inflatables/logo.webp\" alt=\"Easy Inflatables logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Easy Inflatables</a></h2><p>An inflatable can keep shore access in the cruising plan while the yacht remains on a mooring or at anchor.</p><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/ferosticker/logo.webp\" alt=\"FeroSticker logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">FeroSticker</a></h2><p>An engine space presents a specific environment, so FeroSticker should never be selected from dimensions alone.</p><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/brand/partners/flying-fish.webp\" alt=\"Flying Fish Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Flying Fish Sailing</a></h2><p>A dependable engine does not replace the need to understand the sailing boat around it.</p><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/honu/logo.webp\" alt=\"Honu Paddleboards logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Honu</a></h2><p>Once the engine is shut down at an anchorage, a paddleboard offers another way to enjoy being afloat.</p><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/logo.svg\" alt=\"Mainstay Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Mainstay Sailing</a></h2><p>An owner investing in engine maintenance may also want to build confidence using the yacht.</p><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/shakesure/logo.webp\" alt=\"ShakeSure logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">ShakeSure</a></h2><p>Reliable propulsion and suitable ground tackle are separate parts of a cruising plan.</p><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/sos-marine/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"SOS Marine logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">SOS Marine</a></h2><p>Engine maintenance can leave lockers open and equipment temporarily displaced.</p><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/survival-official-logo.png\" alt=\"SURVIVAL First Aid Kits logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">SURVIVAL</a></h2><p>A maintenance visit is an easy time to discover the first-aid kit has been buried beneath tools.</p><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/water-makers-australia/logo.webp\" alt=\"Water Makers Australia logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Water Makers Australia</a></h2><p>A watermaker proposal should be considered against the boat&#x27;s actual power sources and available installation space.</p><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article></div></section>";
